M10 private application MCP bridge (implementation in progress):
- Uses the existing official @modelcontextprotocol/server and core 2.0.0, plus
  zod 4.6.7; runtime CJS bundles their local locked code rather than finding a
  user-installed SDK or Node. Original installed package metadata and LICENSE
  texts are retained in licenses/M10/bridge/; server and Zod texts are also
